      "text": "🇫🇷 France's Yellow Vests call nationwide protests for October 31 as mass rallies hit Paris\n\nAfter demonstrations in Paris today, France's Yellow Vests movement has announced a new nationwide wave of protests on October 31, according to French media.\n\nThe movement is calling for rallies and sit-ins outside the National Assembly in Paris and at town halls across the country.\n\nOrganizers accuse President Emmanuel Macron and Prime Minister Sébastien Lecornu's government of an \"authoritarian drift,\" pointing to sweeping bans on demonstrations.\n\n\"Our freedoms are under threat,\" the movement's representatives said, warning of growing public anger that the authorities keep ignoring.\n\n\"We will protest for the freedom to demonstrate and for all our freedoms,\" the organizers added.\n\n🔴 @DDGeopolitics",
